WEBVTT

00:14.541 --> 00:15.750
Don't hold back.

00:16.791 --> 00:19.458
I am the original Viral Hit.

00:27.250 --> 00:29.250
Shut up, you're coming with us.

00:35.083 --> 00:36.208
You little…

00:49.333 --> 00:50.541
What's going on?!

01:01.958 --> 01:03.125
BE STRONGER!

01:03.208 --> 01:04.958
I had the same keychain.

01:07.000 --> 01:08.250
I know it's childish.

01:08.958 --> 01:10.416
No, it's not.

01:10.500 --> 01:11.333
But…

01:13.083 --> 01:15.083
it was really important to me.

01:15.875 --> 01:18.416
She's moving in with us
starting next week.

01:18.916 --> 01:20.666
We're already legally married.

01:24.333 --> 01:25.375
Last year,

01:26.125 --> 01:27.958
my mother passed away.

01:28.583 --> 01:30.791
My Dad remarried recently.

01:33.041 --> 01:34.541
I had it for a long time,

01:35.541 --> 01:37.250
but I lost it somewhere.

01:38.583 --> 01:39.416
I kept

01:39.958 --> 01:41.250
looking for it.

01:45.666 --> 01:47.750
And then I happened to find the same one.

01:59.833 --> 02:01.541
NEWTUBE@VIRAL_HIT

02:04.583 --> 02:06.583
FIGHTING MINDSET
UNLISTED

02:07.333 --> 02:10.791
Hello, guys. I'm TOU-KEI.

02:11.291 --> 02:13.750
I'll teach you how to get stronger.

02:13.833 --> 02:14.666
But…

02:15.625 --> 02:17.625
why did you send me those videos?

02:18.250 --> 02:21.291
I saw you going through a rough time.

02:23.625 --> 02:25.083
-Huh?
-Ow.

02:28.583 --> 02:29.583
I'm so sorry.

02:30.166 --> 02:32.458
I thought I might be able to help.

02:33.458 --> 02:37.625
That's why I sent you the links
to the videos one by one.

02:44.083 --> 02:46.166
Don't you ever mess with me again.

02:46.250 --> 02:47.750
@HOW_TO_FIGHT

02:47.833 --> 02:49.208
I had no idea…

02:50.208 --> 02:53.083
-I'm sorry.
-No, I'm grateful.

02:53.583 --> 02:55.583
You barely knew me,

02:56.125 --> 02:57.791
but you cared about me.

03:02.708 --> 03:03.875
In any case,

03:04.625 --> 03:06.416
there aren't any more videos.

03:06.500 --> 03:07.541
What?

03:07.625 --> 03:08.791
So…

03:09.375 --> 03:11.291
The medical fee exemption.

03:12.708 --> 03:14.583
I need you to reconsider it.

03:19.000 --> 03:20.291
I should get going.

03:21.541 --> 03:22.708
Asamiya.

03:26.750 --> 03:27.916
Will I

03:28.666 --> 03:30.166
get to see you again?

03:35.375 --> 03:36.208
Yeah.

04:05.041 --> 04:06.375
Goodbye.

04:10.208 --> 04:12.041
-Are you okay, Mom?
-Yes.

04:20.583 --> 04:21.958
Here we go.

04:24.250 --> 04:25.083
Phew.

04:26.375 --> 04:27.916
-Thank you.
-Sure.

04:29.125 --> 04:30.083
Ms. Kaho?

04:30.166 --> 04:31.750
Oh, hi there.

04:31.833 --> 04:34.416
Are you looking for the director?

04:34.500 --> 04:35.625
Oh, no.

04:37.041 --> 04:39.583
Do you know who that person is?

04:40.416 --> 04:42.291
Oh, that's Mr. Shimura.

04:43.291 --> 04:45.166
He's such a good son.

04:45.666 --> 04:48.208
He takes really good care of his mom.

04:48.291 --> 04:50.416
She's in and out of the hospital.

04:50.916 --> 04:52.375
I'm Kaho Asamiya.

04:52.458 --> 04:54.000
I'm excited to start work.

04:54.083 --> 04:55.875
Ask if you need help.

04:55.958 --> 04:57.000
Okay.

04:59.291 --> 05:00.125
Hot!

05:12.208 --> 05:13.916
There it is. I found it.

05:16.166 --> 05:17.250
Thank you!

05:18.458 --> 05:19.500
Kaho!

05:22.500 --> 05:23.791
No way…

05:27.166 --> 05:28.375
Asamiya!

05:40.958 --> 05:42.250
I'm home.

05:44.291 --> 05:45.625
Where were you?

05:46.875 --> 05:48.000
Just out.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.250
Did you go see that guy Kuwata?

05:53.666 --> 05:54.916
I apologize.

05:56.250 --> 05:59.583
I was worried about you,
and went into your room.

06:00.291 --> 06:02.125
What? Mind your own business.

06:02.208 --> 06:05.833
What kind of parent would leave
their child to suffer alone?

06:07.000 --> 06:08.750
This is our problem.

06:08.833 --> 06:10.916
-Not yours.
-No.

06:11.416 --> 06:12.958
I'm responsible too.

06:14.625 --> 06:16.416
I'm saying I'll help you.

06:23.750 --> 06:25.750
Where were you? You're home late.

06:33.416 --> 06:35.250
Were you seeing that man again?

06:36.791 --> 06:38.458
You promised not to see him anymore.

06:40.708 --> 06:42.875
I went to say goodbye.

06:44.166 --> 06:48.125
From now on, you're only allowed
to go out for school and cram school.

06:49.000 --> 06:51.958
I'll be tracking
your whereabouts with GPS.

06:53.458 --> 06:54.333
Understand?

07:03.791 --> 07:06.666
BE STRONGER!
NEWTUBE @VIRAL_HIT

07:08.791 --> 07:11.333
You won't get
any more videos from TOU-KEI.

07:18.791 --> 07:20.208
MMA MATCH

08:04.458 --> 08:05.333
So?

08:05.416 --> 08:07.125
Have you made up your mind?

08:08.375 --> 08:09.208
Yes.

08:10.208 --> 08:11.166
I have.

08:11.791 --> 08:12.916
I see.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.166
I'm telling the police.

08:16.041 --> 08:17.208
Rumi.

08:20.208 --> 08:24.208
You… can't be serious.

08:24.291 --> 08:26.291
Or I'll talk to Mr. Kuwata, the CEO.

08:31.500 --> 08:35.166
You really think Mr. Kuwata doesn't know?

08:40.416 --> 08:42.666
He's the one giving out the orders.

08:45.541 --> 08:47.708
He does this

08:48.583 --> 08:52.958
to extort money
from stupid and weak people like you.

08:54.625 --> 08:55.458
Then…

08:56.916 --> 08:58.833
what if I go to the police?

09:00.500 --> 09:03.291
Do you know what
making an enemy of him means?

09:03.375 --> 09:04.208
Huh?

09:07.000 --> 09:08.541
You're gonna get erased.

09:08.625 --> 09:10.083
If he is…

09:12.375 --> 09:14.041
then you need to protect him.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.333
I'll be erased?

09:17.125 --> 09:18.750
No, I don't believe it.

09:24.541 --> 09:25.583
Then…

09:28.041 --> 09:29.541
why don't we find out?

09:30.416 --> 09:31.291
Hm?

09:33.000 --> 09:38.625
Someone tried to do
the same thing as you before.

09:48.166 --> 09:49.583
You still alive?

10:03.916 --> 10:05.208
I'm against the match.

10:05.291 --> 10:06.625
You should decline.

10:08.708 --> 10:12.083
You've been able to win so far
because the fights had no rules.

10:12.833 --> 10:16.166
Fighting a trained fighter
in the ring is a different story.

10:16.750 --> 10:19.958
But… I need the money.

10:21.166 --> 10:23.916
Do you actually think
you'll get donations now?

10:25.500 --> 10:27.875
You need to stop making her suffer.

10:29.166 --> 10:33.416
Kaho doesn't want
to see you get hurt anymore.

10:35.875 --> 10:38.041
I can't help you this time.

10:46.958 --> 10:49.250
What am I supposed to do?

10:50.125 --> 10:52.333
There aren't any more videos…

11:03.208 --> 11:06.791
"Hello guys. I'm TOU-KEI."

11:09.083 --> 11:09.916
Huh?

11:15.875 --> 11:16.708
Aki?

11:17.333 --> 11:18.666
Get here right now.

11:19.166 --> 11:21.041
And bring Logan with you.

11:23.625 --> 11:25.083
I'm so confused.

11:26.375 --> 11:28.250
Logan is an old friend of mine.

11:28.750 --> 11:30.625
He was watching Viral Hit too.

11:31.125 --> 11:31.958
Hold on.

11:32.041 --> 11:33.416
You knew about TOU-KEI?

11:33.500 --> 11:34.625
Calm down.

11:35.333 --> 11:36.583
Before that,

11:37.166 --> 11:39.458
how did you get access to the videos?

11:43.750 --> 11:46.750
The person who found this sent them to me.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.791
This is mine.

11:48.875 --> 11:50.125
You piss me off.

11:50.208 --> 11:51.750
Gloomy-ass bitch.

11:53.583 --> 11:55.708
I never imagined you'd have it.

11:55.791 --> 11:56.958
So…

11:58.125 --> 12:00.166
Are you TOU-KEI, Mr. Logan?

12:01.625 --> 12:02.458
Huh?

12:03.291 --> 12:05.750
Then who is TOU-KEI?

12:06.250 --> 12:07.083
It's me.

12:13.166 --> 12:14.000
No way!

12:14.875 --> 12:16.458
It's been a while, Master.

12:17.041 --> 12:17.875
"Master"?

12:17.958 --> 12:19.375
Don't call me that.

12:20.041 --> 12:21.750
I don't deserve that title.

12:21.833 --> 12:25.625
My father used to fight
in the American MMA organization, UFC.

12:26.791 --> 12:31.583
After I retired, I became Logan's coach,
but he got injured during practice.

12:32.083 --> 12:34.166
My father felt responsible,

12:34.250 --> 12:37.208
so he left MMA,
and moved back to Japan with me.

12:37.291 --> 12:40.791
But your body is a bit…

12:40.875 --> 12:42.833
It looks smaller, right?

12:42.916 --> 12:44.000
It's the yoga.

12:44.083 --> 12:45.125
Yoga?

12:45.208 --> 12:49.375
Yoga was the undefeated fighter
Rickson Gracie's secret weapon.

12:49.458 --> 12:50.625
You should try sometime.

12:51.708 --> 12:53.416
I think I'll pass.

12:53.916 --> 12:54.958
Those videos…

12:56.500 --> 12:58.000
I made them for Aki.

12:58.958 --> 13:00.125
For Aki?

13:00.625 --> 13:04.583
Aki had a difficult time
adjusting to life abroad.

13:06.291 --> 13:10.291
Her only friend was her pet chicken.

13:11.375 --> 13:12.875
P-CHAN'S GRAVE

13:12.958 --> 13:15.041
But that chicken

13:15.541 --> 13:17.333
passed away.

13:48.500 --> 13:50.750
BE STRONGER!
NEWTUBE@VIRAL_HIT

13:52.541 --> 13:55.791
Hello guys. I'm TOU-KEI.

13:56.416 --> 13:59.291
I'll teach you how to get stronger.

13:59.791 --> 14:04.166
At first, I made them to cheer Aki up,
but I started to get into it.

14:04.250 --> 14:06.500
I was glad you did it.

14:06.583 --> 14:07.416
Huh?

14:09.375 --> 14:11.000
Aki told me everything.

14:11.500 --> 14:14.416
I swore I'd never do martial arts again,

14:14.500 --> 14:15.833
but Aki chose you.

14:15.916 --> 14:18.166
I'll find out if you're worthy of her.

14:18.250 --> 14:19.291
There seems to be--

14:19.375 --> 14:20.250
No time.

14:20.333 --> 14:21.583
We'll start right away.

14:22.541 --> 14:24.125
-Let's go.
-Yes, sir.

14:34.625 --> 14:36.000
-Try to keep up.
-Yes!

14:40.125 --> 14:41.750
-One, two, hook!
-Yeah, hook!

14:50.625 --> 14:51.666
Raise your elbow!

14:52.916 --> 14:54.041
Higher. Higher!

14:54.125 --> 14:55.375
Raise your elbow!

14:56.708 --> 14:58.458
After you plant your feet.

15:05.791 --> 15:06.666
Good.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.125
Higher.

15:28.291 --> 15:33.500
HIS FAMILY IS DIRT POOR LOL

15:34.791 --> 15:36.708
VIRAL HIT
ONSLAUGHT OF DEATH THREATS!!!

15:56.583 --> 15:57.416
One more!

16:33.750 --> 16:35.083
That's it!

16:44.333 --> 16:46.458
You did well to hold out this long.

16:48.208 --> 16:51.458
Tomorrow will be
the last day of this training.

16:52.333 --> 16:53.333
Do you think

16:54.250 --> 16:55.500
I can win?

16:56.791 --> 16:57.625
No.

16:59.291 --> 17:00.958
I'm sorry, but…

17:02.125 --> 17:04.083
you won't be able to win the match.

17:05.291 --> 17:06.125
Huh?

17:20.875 --> 17:22.291
USING A CAMERA IS TIRING

17:22.375 --> 17:23.875
YOU'RE MAKING A LADY WORK

17:29.125 --> 17:30.291
READ

17:34.458 --> 17:36.291
Hey, what are you up to?

17:38.875 --> 17:41.625
You're the one who started Viral Hit.

17:41.708 --> 17:43.541
You have to be a part of this.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.750
Shimura's worried about you too.

17:51.375 --> 17:52.208
Sheesh.

17:52.791 --> 17:54.666
You're making a lady work.

17:56.500 --> 17:58.166
AKI YASHIO

18:21.083 --> 18:22.041
Kanegon?

18:26.125 --> 18:29.291
This is quite amazing, isn't it?

18:30.916 --> 18:33.208
You created Viral Hit,

18:33.708 --> 18:35.458
and it's truly gone viral.

18:40.958 --> 18:41.958
Aki…

18:44.333 --> 18:45.333
I'm sorry.

18:46.625 --> 18:47.500
I…

18:47.583 --> 18:48.583
For me…

18:51.583 --> 18:54.791
Viral Hit is better
when you're part of it.

19:01.125 --> 19:04.458
After all, you're a great producer.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.791
We need you on the team.

19:13.041 --> 19:14.166
Come back.

19:16.125 --> 19:17.208
We'll be waiting.

19:35.208 --> 19:38.916
VIRAL HIT BELONGS TO THE THREE OF US

20:15.916 --> 20:17.208
Tomorrow's the big day.

20:17.708 --> 20:19.791
Yeah. Is this…

20:21.833 --> 20:24.541
It's too warm for that now.

20:26.125 --> 20:27.833
Use it next year.

20:28.750 --> 20:30.750
No. I'm taking it with me.

20:30.833 --> 20:31.666
Thanks.

20:37.083 --> 20:38.291
I'm so sorry.

20:40.083 --> 20:42.833
That's all I can do for you.

20:45.083 --> 20:46.875
What's this all of a sudden?

20:48.041 --> 20:53.166
I wish I could give a piece of my mind
to the people badmouthing you.

20:55.541 --> 20:58.291
I'd tell them how kind you really are.

21:01.250 --> 21:02.583
Stop it.

21:04.416 --> 21:07.500
If only I weren't so sick…

21:09.416 --> 21:11.250
I would let you do

21:11.875 --> 21:13.750
whatever you wanted to do.

21:21.541 --> 21:22.833
You've got it wrong.

21:27.458 --> 21:29.083
Of course, at first,

21:29.791 --> 21:31.500
I was doing this for you.

21:32.375 --> 21:33.291
But now,

21:35.333 --> 21:37.333
there's more to it.

21:40.083 --> 21:42.375
It made me realize even a klutz like me

21:43.291 --> 21:45.875
can be capable of certain things.

21:47.750 --> 21:49.916
"I'm alive right now."

21:52.000 --> 21:53.291
I've never…

21:55.791 --> 21:58.333
felt that way before now.

22:01.541 --> 22:02.583
And besides,

22:04.250 --> 22:06.500
I made friends for the first time.

22:08.458 --> 22:10.208
When I'm with them,

22:11.000 --> 22:13.125
they annoy me so much,

22:14.000 --> 22:15.500
and they make me suffer.

22:16.708 --> 22:17.583
But…

22:22.500 --> 22:23.333
But…

22:24.541 --> 22:26.875
I'm having the time of my life.

22:29.166 --> 22:30.958
Remember what you said to me?

22:31.833 --> 22:35.458
You said, "You are only young once."

22:38.083 --> 22:41.000
Viral Hit is my youth.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.583
I'll do my very best

22:46.625 --> 22:48.041
in my final match.

22:49.833 --> 22:50.791
So…

23:00.208 --> 23:01.041
So…

23:04.666 --> 23:06.416
You can't give up either.

23:10.000 --> 23:13.125
Why are you worried about me?

23:15.083 --> 23:17.208
I'm not going to die so easily.

23:20.791 --> 23:24.375
You should be worrying about yourself.

23:29.333 --> 23:31.500
I don't want to see you get hit

23:33.000 --> 23:35.375
or hitting anyone else.

23:45.541 --> 23:48.125
But don't you dare die before me.

24:22.791 --> 24:23.625
DOXXED

24:23.708 --> 24:26.541
HOT GIRLFRIEND'S DAD
RUNS URABE GENERAL HOSPITAL

24:31.041 --> 24:31.958
Wow.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.625
Huh? Dude, check it out.

24:35.708 --> 24:37.833
Isn't that the Viral Hit girlfriend?

24:37.916 --> 24:38.916
The fake fights?

24:39.000 --> 24:40.041
That's the one.

24:40.125 --> 24:42.000
She doesn't look like her photo.

24:42.083 --> 24:42.916
Stop staring.

24:43.000 --> 24:44.125
Isn't that girl…

24:44.208 --> 24:45.708
Yeah, it's her.

24:46.916 --> 24:48.291
HER NAME IS KAHO ASAMIYA

24:48.375 --> 24:50.083
SHE'S A SENSELESS SPOILED BRAT

24:50.166 --> 24:51.583
SHE DESERVED THE ASSAULT

25:02.833 --> 25:05.875
Your childish games won't work forever.

25:05.958 --> 25:08.166
This must be him. Kuwata did it.

25:08.250 --> 25:10.875
He said he saw Kuwata
where his friend died.

25:10.958 --> 25:13.250
Do you actually think
you'll get donations?

25:13.333 --> 25:14.958
I need you to reconsider it.

25:15.041 --> 25:17.291
I don't want to see you get hit,

25:18.708 --> 25:20.875
or hitting anyone else.

25:21.375 --> 25:24.083
But don't you dare die before me.

25:53.750 --> 25:55.083
I'm off.

26:15.208 --> 26:18.750
The hospital has been receiving
prank calls as well.

26:19.583 --> 26:23.083
You… dragged our name through the mud.

26:23.666 --> 26:27.083
All because
you got involved with a man like him.

26:29.916 --> 26:33.958
I truly regret marrying your mother.

26:37.375 --> 26:40.250
You are not allowed
to contact anyone anymore.

27:14.416 --> 27:16.500
GIRLFRIEND HOPED TO
GET INTO MED SCHOOL!

27:16.583 --> 27:17.458
Hey, Aki.

27:17.541 --> 27:18.666
NOT FIT TO BE A DOC

27:18.750 --> 27:21.583
Do you think
I went around this the wrong way?

27:22.833 --> 27:24.083
What do you mean?

27:25.750 --> 27:27.000
Because of me,

27:28.041 --> 27:30.625
people who are important to me got hurt.

27:32.208 --> 27:35.083
I never meant to hurt anyone.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.166
There are

27:45.250 --> 27:47.541
people who were saved by you too.

27:52.041 --> 27:53.375
At the very least,

27:54.333 --> 27:56.041
I am one of them.

27:59.500 --> 28:01.083
If it weren't for you,

28:03.208 --> 28:05.416
I'd still be alone.

28:12.625 --> 28:13.583
Shimura.

28:16.666 --> 28:18.333
To me, you are…

28:19.750 --> 28:21.500
my one-and-only hero.

28:26.958 --> 28:27.833
Aki…

28:32.500 --> 28:33.333
It's time.

28:33.916 --> 28:35.125
Okay.

28:40.375 --> 28:42.041
Remember what I said before.

28:42.625 --> 28:44.583
You're not alone.

28:44.666 --> 28:47.833
TOU-KEI

28:56.708 --> 28:58.250
All right, let's go.

28:58.750 --> 29:01.625
Show them what Viral Hit's made of.

29:01.708 --> 29:03.166
I'll give him

29:04.083 --> 29:05.750
a good beating.

29:05.833 --> 29:06.666
Yeah.

29:07.166 --> 29:08.375
Knock him out.

29:21.625 --> 29:23.291
Thank you for waiting.

29:23.791 --> 29:27.291
We will now commence the main event.

29:29.666 --> 29:31.041
In the blue corner,

29:31.541 --> 29:35.166
known for his
sensational live-streaming fights.

29:35.250 --> 29:37.333
A full-time high school student.

29:38.208 --> 29:40.000
Representing Viral Hit

29:40.791 --> 29:43.250
is Kota Shimura!

30:18.125 --> 30:19.666
He's on enemy turf.

30:23.000 --> 30:24.333
All right.

30:25.166 --> 30:26.583
Good luck.

30:34.583 --> 30:37.750
KUWATA 172,300 YEN VS SHIMURA 300 YEN

30:40.583 --> 30:43.208
Next up, in the red corner,

30:44.208 --> 30:47.083
is the creator of BAD FELLOWS

30:48.750 --> 30:51.583
and a revolutionary
in the world of martial arts.

30:52.250 --> 30:54.291
Yugo Kuwata!

30:55.708 --> 30:56.541
Go, Kuwata!

30:56.625 --> 30:58.000
You rock!

31:03.125 --> 31:04.291
Kuwata!

31:10.291 --> 31:11.291
Kuwata!

31:14.208 --> 31:15.208
Kuwata!

31:38.333 --> 31:39.416
Center!

31:44.166 --> 31:45.541
Three five-minute rounds.

31:45.625 --> 31:47.125
BAD FELLOWS rules apply.

31:47.208 --> 31:50.708
No headbutts, no illegal strikes,
no biting, no eye gouging.

31:50.791 --> 31:52.125
Touch gloves!

31:55.375 --> 31:58.666
How's it going?
Think you'll make a lot of money?

32:01.208 --> 32:03.041
Everyone's dying to see

32:04.208 --> 32:08.000
you, the villain,
get beaten and humiliated.

32:09.125 --> 32:11.750
You're the one
who's gonna get beaten and humiliated.

32:13.083 --> 32:14.166
Back to your corners.

32:24.041 --> 32:25.833
Round one!

32:25.916 --> 32:27.125
Fight!

32:33.916 --> 32:35.041
Go, Kuwata!

32:45.250 --> 32:46.250
Damn it.

32:51.833 --> 32:54.958
What's the matter?
You've yet to land a single blow.

33:04.416 --> 33:06.125
Go, Kuwata!

33:08.333 --> 33:11.791
If the game ends in the first round,
there's no money

33:12.375 --> 33:13.625
for you.

33:18.916 --> 33:19.875
SHIMURA 300YEN

33:19.958 --> 33:21.208
It's no good…

33:29.750 --> 33:31.250
START LIVESTREAM

33:37.750 --> 33:38.791
Hello, everyone.

33:39.291 --> 33:40.791
IS IT REALLY HER?

33:40.875 --> 33:42.250
HE'S FIGHTING NOW!

33:42.333 --> 33:45.000
I'm sorry for
causing a stir on social media.

33:47.416 --> 33:49.333
I'm the Viral Hit girlfriend.

33:49.416 --> 33:52.416
VIRAL HIT'S GIRLFRIEND IS LIVE!

33:55.083 --> 33:56.500
I saw…

33:57.333 --> 33:58.500
IT'S REALLY HER LOL

33:58.583 --> 34:02.791
…many comments bashing Shimura,
saying he's making money with violence.

34:03.833 --> 34:04.791
Of course,

34:06.291 --> 34:08.583
violence should never be justified.

34:10.250 --> 34:11.083
But…

34:13.208 --> 34:15.500
I am partially to blame for Shimura

34:17.291 --> 34:18.833
turning to violence.

34:22.000 --> 34:23.458
I have spent my life

34:24.333 --> 34:25.958
obeying my parents.

34:26.875 --> 34:28.708
I've lived my life in shackles.

34:29.375 --> 34:31.750
At some point, I stopped fighting back.

34:32.250 --> 34:35.125
It was easier to stay weak…

34:37.291 --> 34:39.625
than to resist or rebel against something.

34:42.083 --> 34:44.375
Facing reality and fighting back

34:45.000 --> 34:46.750
takes a lot of courage.

34:47.791 --> 34:49.583
It's not something easy to do.

34:51.416 --> 34:52.875
Before I knew it,

34:53.583 --> 34:55.250
I started to see myself in Shimura.

34:56.333 --> 34:57.958
When Shimura fought,

34:59.375 --> 35:01.791
I felt like I had become stronger too.

35:04.041 --> 35:04.958
Surely…

35:05.458 --> 35:06.458
HE GAVE ME COURAGE

35:06.541 --> 35:07.375
TRUE

35:07.458 --> 35:09.833
…I wasn't the only one.

35:09.916 --> 35:11.083
I'M TEARING UP

35:11.166 --> 35:12.750
MY HEART IS POUNDING

35:12.833 --> 35:14.875
Shimura is strong…

35:18.083 --> 35:19.875
because he has someone to protect.

35:22.416 --> 35:24.083
The only way to change his reality…

35:27.000 --> 35:29.625
was to raise his fist.

35:36.166 --> 35:39.166
If you're going to criticize Shimura
for his violence…

35:39.250 --> 35:40.333
I MISUNDERSTOOD HIM

35:40.416 --> 35:44.875
…then what about the justice you demand
while hiding behind your screens?

35:45.458 --> 35:49.458
You think it's okay
to make assumptions and gang up on him.

35:50.458 --> 35:52.208
That kind of justice

35:54.166 --> 35:56.291
is the worst kind of violence.

36:00.625 --> 36:02.875
I won't run or hide anymore.

36:04.791 --> 36:05.666
I've decided

36:07.208 --> 36:09.416
to talk to you all here.

36:11.750 --> 36:13.958
To fight against invisible violence.

36:48.416 --> 36:49.458
Thanks.

36:53.500 --> 36:55.166
Shimura! Look at this!

36:56.916 --> 36:58.875
We've started to get donations.

36:58.958 --> 36:59.791
What?

37:00.791 --> 37:03.166
YOUR GIRLFRIEND'S STORY MOVED ME

37:03.250 --> 37:05.333
Let go of me! Let go!

37:07.583 --> 37:08.583
-Kanegon?
-Hey!

37:08.666 --> 37:09.625
Shimura!

37:13.041 --> 37:13.875
I made it.

37:13.958 --> 37:15.333
Your face is bruised.

37:15.416 --> 37:18.500
I got hassled by some punks
on my way here.

37:18.583 --> 37:21.166
Never mind that. How's it going?

37:21.250 --> 37:23.250
How's my counter punch working?

37:23.333 --> 37:25.291
YOUR GIRLFRIEND IS ROOTING FOR YOU

37:30.750 --> 37:32.375
Hey, Viral Hit's girlfriend.

37:32.458 --> 37:33.791
I need a favor.

37:33.875 --> 37:35.166
Was this your doing?

37:35.250 --> 37:36.291
Yeah.

37:36.375 --> 37:39.208
And we've got more than one punch.

37:40.833 --> 37:42.583
She's probably wreaking havoc now too.

37:44.375 --> 37:46.541
KOTA SHIMURA 145,900 YEN

37:48.416 --> 37:49.958
That little shit.

37:52.833 --> 37:53.833
Rumi.

37:54.666 --> 37:55.958
The hell do you want?

37:56.041 --> 37:57.791
I thought I'd let you know.

37:58.291 --> 38:01.416
THE DARK SIDE OF INFLUENCER AGENCIES

38:01.500 --> 38:02.333
Huh?

38:02.833 --> 38:04.166
You'll get erased.

38:04.250 --> 38:07.708
I heard he's killed a person before…

38:07.791 --> 38:09.166
What have you done?

38:09.750 --> 38:10.916
Is it true?

38:12.250 --> 38:15.250
Did he and some others
really beat a boy to death?

38:16.541 --> 38:18.000
There weren't others.

38:18.750 --> 38:20.583
It was Kuwata.

38:21.083 --> 38:22.958
Kuwata did it all on his own.

38:23.458 --> 38:24.541
Wow.

38:24.625 --> 38:27.000
It's already got 10,000 likes.

38:27.083 --> 38:28.666
Bitch, do you understand--

38:28.750 --> 38:29.833
Hey!

38:30.583 --> 38:32.125
Maybe you'll be the one

38:33.250 --> 38:35.250
that gets erased.

38:46.916 --> 38:49.291
It's Viral Hit's time now.

38:56.250 --> 38:57.291
Nice run.

38:59.041 --> 39:02.125
Shimura,
you've got nothing to worry about now.

39:03.750 --> 39:07.041
You're not the only one
standing in the ring.

39:08.500 --> 39:11.583
Everyone is fighting alongside you.

39:12.875 --> 39:14.250
Go knock him out!

39:15.250 --> 39:17.625
We'll use our trick in the next round.

39:26.791 --> 39:28.750
Seconds out. Seconds out.

39:33.166 --> 39:34.291
Get him, Shimura!

39:38.333 --> 39:39.250
Get him!

39:41.625 --> 39:43.458
The donations are skyrocketing.

39:43.541 --> 39:45.125
When did this happen?

39:45.958 --> 39:49.791
I told you I'm a great producer.

39:53.958 --> 39:54.791
Yeah.

40:04.958 --> 40:05.916
What's wrong?

40:06.000 --> 40:08.583
Huh? Did you cover him in something?

40:08.666 --> 40:09.875
It's vegetable oil.

40:10.375 --> 40:12.083
You've got some nerve.

40:12.791 --> 40:15.916
This is a fight, isn't it?

40:18.041 --> 40:19.666
Please lend me your help.

40:21.166 --> 40:22.083
And

40:23.291 --> 40:25.916
please support Kota Shimura.

40:26.000 --> 40:27.375
What are you doing?

40:27.875 --> 40:29.666
-Hand it over.
-Stop!

40:29.750 --> 40:30.750
Give it to me!

40:31.541 --> 40:33.750
Haven't you humiliated me enough?

40:33.833 --> 40:35.291
Stop it!

40:36.125 --> 40:39.083
I hope you understand what you're doing.

40:41.166 --> 40:43.166
This is why you're a failure and--

40:43.250 --> 40:45.125
I've had enough!

40:56.625 --> 40:59.375
Fighting mindset, rule one.

40:59.458 --> 41:01.250
Don't lose your cool.

41:02.583 --> 41:04.708
You little brat.

41:10.875 --> 41:12.750
-Get on.
-Tatsuya!

41:18.291 --> 41:19.750
Get out of there!

41:29.125 --> 41:30.000
This is bad.

41:30.083 --> 41:31.708
That punch made him serious.

41:35.250 --> 41:36.375
Get your guard up!

41:53.375 --> 41:54.875
Kota, Kota!

41:56.166 --> 41:57.375
Go to the corner!

41:57.458 --> 41:58.500
The donations?

41:58.583 --> 42:00.125
Only around two million.

42:00.208 --> 42:03.250
Shimura! Get up! You can't be done yet!

42:03.333 --> 42:04.416
Get up, Shimura!

42:04.500 --> 42:05.541
Seven…

42:05.625 --> 42:08.041
Eight, nine…

42:08.541 --> 42:10.000
You okay? Good to go?

42:10.083 --> 42:10.916
Fight!

42:12.083 --> 42:13.000
Stop!

42:20.500 --> 42:21.666
Shimura, come here.

42:25.416 --> 42:26.708
Saved by the bell.

42:31.458 --> 42:32.291
The donations?

42:32.375 --> 42:33.791
We're still at two million.

42:34.625 --> 42:36.958
That's not nearly enough.

42:37.458 --> 42:39.958
Shimura, this next round is the last.

42:40.458 --> 42:41.416
Hang in there!

42:42.041 --> 42:43.166
I know.

42:43.250 --> 42:45.291
Show them what Viral Hit's made of!

42:50.125 --> 42:51.458
Your mom's watching.

43:22.125 --> 43:23.625
Keep throwing punches!

43:27.041 --> 43:28.333
Get him, Shimura!

43:32.833 --> 43:35.750
What are you doing?
Remember your training!

44:14.625 --> 44:15.583
Yes! You got this!

44:15.666 --> 44:16.625
Go for it!

44:24.750 --> 44:25.666
Thanks, Tatsuya.

44:25.750 --> 44:26.583
Hurry.

45:16.500 --> 45:17.375
Shimura!

45:17.458 --> 45:19.000
Down! Neutral corner!

45:23.208 --> 45:24.208
This is bad.

45:26.083 --> 45:27.416
Hang in there!

45:28.250 --> 45:29.500
Get up, Shimura!

45:29.583 --> 45:30.958
Get up!

46:11.791 --> 46:14.291
HEY, GET UP

46:14.375 --> 46:16.833
PLEASE GET UP

46:19.833 --> 46:21.791
IT'S NOT THE END YET

46:21.875 --> 46:24.083
I NEED YOU TO GET UP!

46:47.041 --> 46:48.541
YOU GAVE US COURAGE

46:48.625 --> 46:50.708
NOW IT'S OUR TURN TO HELP YOU

46:52.625 --> 46:54.166
WE'LL NEVER ABANDON YOU

46:54.250 --> 46:56.625
WE'RE YOUR FRIENDS TOO

47:01.375 --> 47:03.750
LET US DREAM ONE MORE TIME

47:09.833 --> 47:11.333
Shimura, get up!

47:33.500 --> 47:34.750
Shimura!

47:36.416 --> 47:38.958
The donations are pouring in!

47:39.041 --> 47:41.583
Shimura! Just a little more!

47:41.666 --> 47:42.833
Hang in there!

47:42.916 --> 47:44.083
You good to go?

47:45.958 --> 47:46.791
Fight!

48:04.375 --> 48:05.541
I'm sorry, but…

48:07.375 --> 48:09.250
you won't be able to win the match.

48:14.083 --> 48:16.458
But that only holds true if it's a match.

48:18.375 --> 48:20.208
He can still beat Kuwata?

48:20.291 --> 48:21.791
If it's a fight.

48:46.916 --> 48:47.750
Stop!

48:47.833 --> 48:49.000
Foul!

48:49.083 --> 48:52.791
Due to Shimura's foul,

48:53.875 --> 48:57.833
the winner of this match is Yugo Kuwata!

49:08.458 --> 49:09.291
IT'S A MIRACLE

49:11.291 --> 49:12.166
Yes!

49:16.333 --> 49:17.791
Well done!

49:18.958 --> 49:21.916
You really are the best streamer ever!

49:28.916 --> 49:29.750
Ouch!

49:31.541 --> 49:32.416
You pass.

49:52.375 --> 49:53.208
Money…

49:54.291 --> 49:55.791
How much did we make?

50:08.208 --> 50:15.208
VIRAL HIT

51:32.916 --> 51:36.000
Subtitle translation by:
Kanako Connie Takahashi
